    <div><p class="bunker-eyebrow">NODE ADMINISTRATION / AWS-HOSTED SIGNING</p><h1 id="bunker-heading">AWS Nostr bunker</h1>
      <p class="bunker-workflow-outline">Accept operational responsibility for this AWS-hosted Nostr signer, then use this page for ongoing health checks.</p>
